Yanis,

Real Lojban is not necessarily perfect Lojban. You won't find
perfection anywhere. But it's possible to know what Lojban is, and to
come close enough to recognize it. Even the CLL only comes 99.999999
percent close, because it has some errors.

It's good enough that we have recognition. When you vary so much that
those who know Lojban extremely well can't recognize it, that's a lot
more than making a slight difference that is still recognizable.

-Eppcott


